This directory contains the Wayland core protocol and selected
extension protocol XML files vendored from upstream.

Sources:
  - wayland.xml
      From: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland
      Tag:    1.25.0
      Commit: 3e673a438b0a9749e3bdf5cac4befac86333024c

  - protocols/xdg-shell.xml
  - protocols/xdg-decoration-unstable-v1.xml
      From: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland-protocols
      Tag:    1.48
      Commit: 02e63e74a807afed95bc25a386173110afef24e3

Each XML file additionally carries its own per-file <copyright> block
in-line (see the `<copyright>` element near the top of each file).
The blocks below reproduce the project-level COPYING notices verbatim.

